{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: hack the bank and get rich, but the path is anything but. Crack passwords, hack phones, and sift through private data. Bypass firewalls and connect the dots to breach the world's first quantum computer, the system they say is unbreakable.<br><br><strong>Terminal</strong><br>The entire game unfolds inside a simulated operating system that feels alive. Every action such as scanning networks, reading files, decrypting messages, or running custom scripts happens through a fully interactive terminal. You will type real commands, explore hidden domains, and uncover secrets buried deep within the Central Bank Corporation\u2019s network. Do not worry, no previous knowledge is required. Everything is documented, and you can start your way with just a help command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/33eb31e0bdc6b4b205c4b98f957b0239.poster.avif?t=1774723778\" width=1120 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/33eb31e0bdc6b4b205c4b98f957b0239.webm?t=1774723778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/33eb31e0bdc6b4b205c4b98f957b0239.mp4?t=1774723778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fix Your Gear</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a broke hacker in a small, old one-room apartment with an outdated computer and worn-out equipment. During the middle of a hack, your computer may stop working. With no other choice, you grab your screwdriver and start repairing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/9286f8ba0af424e547b2bd2281defe8b.poster.avif?t=1774723778\" width=1120 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/9286f8ba0af424e547b2bd2281defe8b.webm?t=1774723778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/9286f8ba0af424e547b2bd2281defe8b.mp4?t=1774723778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy Matters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hacking requires intense focus and energy. Make sure to eat and drink, or you might pass out at your computer and miss your entire operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/b78928ac28396684bca89bd8f24da296.poster.avif?t=1774723778\" width=1120 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/b78928ac28396684bca89bd8f24da296.webm?t=1774723778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/b78928ac28396684bca89bd8f24da296.mp4?t=1774723778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All mission parameters are randomized and unique to each playthrough. After finishing a mission, you'll see a summary screen showing your final rank, so you can start again and aim for better results each time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/de5cbd722d8f3105f53b7cf8c36d0537.poster.avif?t=1774723778\" width=1120 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/de5cbd722d8f3105f53b7cf8c36d0537.webm?t=1774723778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/de5cbd722d8f3105f53b7cf8c36d0537.mp4?t=1774723778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The task is tough, but not impossible. Keep going and don\u2019t give up. Good luck.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078420?t=1774723778","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078420?t=1774723778","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/88cec6af6ec40f15274d8e337ea3d1e3461df159/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774723778","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/88cec6af6ec40f15274d8e337ea3d1e3461df159/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774723778","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game includes themes of computer crime and hacking, mild to moderate language, and references to illegal activity. There is no graphic violence, gore, or sexual content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: hack the bank and get rich, but the path is anything but. Crack passwords, hack phones, and sift through private data. Bypass firewalls and connect the dots to breach the world's first quantum computer, the system they say is unbreakable.<br><br><strong>Terminal</strong><br>The entire game unfolds inside a simulated operating system that feels alive. Every action such as scanning networks, reading files, decrypting messages, or running custom scripts happens through a fully interactive terminal. You will type real commands, explore hidden domains, and uncover secrets buried deep within the Central Bank Corporation\u2019s network. Do not worry, no previous knowledge is required. Everything is documented, and you can start your way with just a help command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/33eb31e0bdc6b4b205c4b98f957b0239.poster.avif?t=1774723778\" width=1120 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/33eb31e0bdc6b4b205c4b98f957b0239.webm?t=1774723778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/33eb31e0bdc6b4b205c4b98f957b0239.mp4?t=1774723778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fix Your Gear</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a broke hacker in a small, old one-room apartment with an outdated computer and worn-out equipment. During the middle of a hack, your computer may stop working. With no other choice, you grab your screwdriver and start repairing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/9286f8ba0af424e547b2bd2281defe8b.poster.avif?t=1774723778\" width=1120 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/9286f8ba0af424e547b2bd2281defe8b.webm?t=1774723778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/9286f8ba0af424e547b2bd2281defe8b.mp4?t=1774723778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy Matters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hacking requires intense focus and energy. Make sure to eat and drink, or you might pass out at your computer and miss your entire operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/b78928ac28396684bca89bd8f24da296.poster.avif?t=1774723778\" width=1120 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/b78928ac28396684bca89bd8f24da296.webm?t=1774723778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/b78928ac28396684bca89bd8f24da296.mp4?t=1774723778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All mission parameters are randomized and unique to each playthrough. After finishing a mission, you'll see a summary screen showing your final rank, so you can start again and aim for better results each time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/de5cbd722d8f3105f53b7cf8c36d0537.poster.avif?t=1774723778\" width=1120 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/de5cbd722d8f3105f53b7cf8c36d0537.webm?t=1774723778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/extras/de5cbd722d8f3105f53b7cf8c36d0537.mp4?t=1774723778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The task is tough, but not impossible. Keep going and don\u2019t give up. Good luck.</p>","developers":["Trajectory Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078420/af6effa21f63bd57d2c0a7986f39e77ef4802a6c/header.jpg?t=1774723778","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Min